=== MODEL ===
With at most 10 points, brute force works. For every choice of 4 points, check whether they form an axis-aligned rectangle with positive area: there must be exactly two distinct x values and two distinct y values, and all four corners (x1,y1),(x1,y2),(x2,y1),(x2,y2) must be present. Then check that no other point lies in the closed rectangle [x1,x2]×[y1,y2], excluding the four corners. If valid, track the max area.

